WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.683
"We love skidding!" said Poppy.

2
00:00:09.684 --> 00:00:14.921
"Our tires are fine!" said Dipper.

3
00:00:14.922 --> 00:00:37.296
Eddy's friends kept skidding.

4
00:00:37.297 --> 00:00:42.761
"That does look like fun," Eddy thought.

5
00:00:42.762 --> 00:00:48.765
"But I'll just watch."

6
00:00:48.766 --> 00:00:54.446
More cars and trucks came over.

7
00:00:54.447 --> 00:00:57.972
"Watch me skid!" yelled a van.

8
00:00:57.973 --> 00:00:59.868
Vroom!

9
00:00:59.869 --> 00:01:02.610
The van made a sharp turn.

10
00:01:02.611 --> 00:01:05.916
She slammed on her brakes.

11
00:01:05.917 --> 00:01:14.020
The van skidded sideways!

12
00:01:14.021 --> 00:01:18.166
"Watch this!" cried a jeep.

13
00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:23.632
He zoomed through the construction site.

14
00:01:23.633 --> 00:01:28.771
The jeep went up the dirt hill.

15
00:01:28.772 --> 00:01:32.122
He flew through the air.

16
00:01:32.123 --> 00:01:36.805
Then he skidded through the dirt.

17
00:01:36.806 --> 00:01:41.139
Everyone cheered.

18
00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:44.050
Eddy sighed.

19
00:01:44.051 --> 00:01:48.083
"Everyone is having fun," he thought.

20
00:01:48.084 --> 00:01:57.151
"But skidding is bad for tires."

